@baseUrl = http://localhost:5236

### Registrar usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ana Perez",
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Crear tarea (reemplazar TOKEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Task
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

{
  "title": "Entregar informe mensual",
  "priorityLevel": 2,
  "notes": "Revisar cifras de ventas"
}

### Listar mis tareas (reemplazar TOKEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Task
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Eliminar tarea (reemplazar TOKEN e ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Task/ID_DE_LA_TAREA
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN
